Subject: [PATCH 035/232] media: i2c: rk628: provider a clock for hdmirx after
 phy poweroff

Signed-off-by: Shunqing Chen <csq@rock-chips.com>
Change-Id: I92e1257490a2cec760fea4ebe8cc9c0de16f819f
Signed-off-by: Guochun Huang <hero.huang@rock-chips.com>
---
 drivers/media/i2c/rk628/rk628_combrxphy.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/media/i2c/rk628/rk628_combrxphy.c b/drivers/media/i2c/rk628/rk628_combrxphy.c
index e241ed6dd2b69f..ad4722187f8b2f 100644
--- a/drivers/media/i2c/rk628/rk628_combrxphy.c
+++ b/drivers/media/i2c/rk628/rk628_combrxphy.c
@@ -532,6 +532,7 @@ int rk628_combrxphy_power_on(int f)
 
 int rk628_combrxphy_power_off(void)
 {
+	rk628_i2c_update_bits(REG(0x6630), BIT(0), BIT(0));
 	return 0;
 }
 
